# Rebuilt by harvest.py. `repos.json` is the search frame and `provenance.tsv`
# pins a blob SHA per fetched file; together they reproduce everything here.
# `manifest.json` says the same thing at 15 MB and rewrites wholesale on every
# fetch, so it stays out.
corpus/
trees.jsonl
skills.json
manifest.json
manifest.jsonl
shortlist.json
run-manifest.json
band-*.json

# `viewer.html` is generated — `build-viewer.py` rebuilds it from the files
# below, and it was costing 7 MB of history per publish because a 3 MB payload
# is inlined into it and does not delta.
viewer.html

# The reading passes write here, and most of what they write is scratch: probe
# arms, retry manifests, per-batch inputs, superseded variants. What is kept is
# what `build-viewer.py` reads, which is the same thing as what would have to be
# paid for again to rebuild the page.
runs/*
!runs/pass2.jsonl
!runs/labels-v2.jsonl
!runs/quote-recheck.jsonl
!runs/null-recovered.json
!runs/facet.jsonl
!runs/facet-ko-fix.jsonl
!runs/facet-recovered.jsonl
!runs/topic.jsonl
!runs/cluster-read.jsonl
!runs/pass1.jsonl
